##PHENOTYPES=Phenotypes associated with overlapping genomic features
##am_class=The AlphaMissense thresholds are: 'Likely benign' if score < 0.34, 'Likely pathogenic' if score > 0.564, 'ambiguous' otherwise -- see doi.org/10.1126/science.adg7492 for details; column from /nfs/public/ro/enswbsites_codon/newsite/live/vep/vep_plugins_data/grch38/AlphaMissense_hg38.tsv.gz
##am_pathogenicity=Continuous AlphaMissense score between 0 and 1 which can be interpreted as the predicted probability of the variant being pathogenic; column from /nfs/public/ro/enswbsites_codon/newsite/live/vep/vep_plugins_data/grch38/AlphaMissense_hg38.tsv.gz
##CADD_PHRED=PHRED-like scaled CADD score. CADD is only available here for non-commercial use. See CADD website for more information.
##CADD_RAW=Raw CADD score. CADD is only available here for non-commercial use. See CADD website for more information.
##REVEL=Rare Exome Variant Ensemble Learner
##SpliceAI_pred_DP_AG=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) delta position (bp) for acceptor gain: position (relative to variant) of max AG change (+ downstream, − upstream).
##SpliceAI_pred_DP_AL=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) delta position (bp) for acceptor loss: position (relative to variant) of max AL change (+ downstream, − upstream).
##SpliceAI_pred_DP_DG=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) delta position (bp) for donor gain: position (relative to variant) of max DG change (+ downstream, − upstream).
##SpliceAI_pred_DP_DL=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) delta position (bp) for donor loss: position (relative to variant) of max DL change (+ downstream, − upstream).
##SpliceAI_pred_DS_AG=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) delta score (0–1) for acceptor gain: max inc. in predicted acceptor probability within ±50 bp. Guide cutoffs: <0.01 none; ≥0.2 high-recall; ≥0.5 recommended; ≥0.8 high-precision.
##SpliceAI_pred_DS_AL=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) delta score (0–1) for acceptor loss: max dec. in predicted acceptor probability within ±50 bp. Guide cutoffs: <0.01 none; ≥0.2 high-recall; ≥0.5 recommended; ≥0.8 high-precision.
##SpliceAI_pred_DS_DG=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) delta score (0–1) for donor gain: max inc. in predicted donor probability within ±50 bp. Guide cutoffs: <0.01 none; ≥0.2 high-recall; ≥0.5 recommended; ≥0.8 high-precision.
##SpliceAI_pred_DS_DL=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) delta score (0–1) for donor loss: max dec. in predicted donor probability within ±50 bp. Guide cutoffs: <0.01 none; ≥0.2 high-recall; ≥0.5 recommended; ≥0.8 high-precision.
##SpliceAI_pred_SYMBOL=SpliceAI (v1.3.1) gene symbol
